WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.620
"How do I love thee?

2
00:00:01.670 --> 00:00:03.500
Let me count the ways."

3
00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:05.000
A counter clicks.

4
00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:06.180
I love thee.

5
00:00:06.230 --> 00:00:06.990
Click.

6
00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:08.170
I love thee.

7
00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:09.180
Click.

8
00:00:09.230 --> 00:00:13.770
Then it reaches into daily
life: "by sun and candlelight".

9
00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:15.780
But the counter keeps clicking.

10
00:00:15.830 --> 00:00:18.070
Can love really be counted?

11
00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:20.980
In this mission, you'll
test her promise to count,

12
00:00:21.030 --> 00:00:22.620
line by line.

13
00:00:22.670 --> 00:00:26.430
You'll hear how "I love thee"
begins clause after clause,

14
00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:28.570
each one adding a new way.

15
00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:30.950
And you'll see why a woman
writing a love sonnet,

16
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:34.840
while Robert Browning courted
her, was breaking with tradition.

17
00:00:34.890 --> 00:00:38.450
Your mission: decide whether
love can really be measured.
